comments.body:
@ymd-arista sorry for the delay I have been on PTO. 

1. I think hard IRQ is not the problem, it looks timing related. When we enabled GRUB debug logging the hang never reproduced, so just slowing down the hand-off is enough to make it disappear.
2. In every case I've seen, it freezes right after the GRUB hand-off. The only onie-nos-install changes were to installation and partitioning, nothing in the boot path. So my assumption is the offending code is somewhere in the Trixie kernel's boot.
